<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3909"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 10, 2005 - 6:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This post made compleatly sence to me. <BR>Username: George <BR>January 09, 2005 - 9:07 pm:      <BR>Jujuree, thanks; BTK&#39;s first letter is one he probably wishes he had back, although it may have worked in the 1970s when there was little information about violent serial crime.  <BR> <BR>In this letter, BTK twice cites &#34;society.&#34; Add to this &#34;the next day after I read the paper&#34; and it may denote Wichita specifically rather than society in general. If it&#39;s on the level, BTK referred to Wichita at least three times in the letter where he wanted a &#34;name.&#34; This may further suggest that BTK harbored an exceptionally hateful grudge against Wichita and it&#39;s inhabitants. It&#39;s a widespread belief that BTK was a lifelong Wichitan, I know, but here are a couple of things which may reinforce this premise. Just speculating.  <BR> <BR>My reply to George, info without mentioning his name: <BR> <BR>Hi George  <BR> <BR>Your post realy sparked a very interesting research for me. i have researched for many houers now and I found a person who might be interesting.  <BR>He resembles the original police sketch &#40;the dark complexed man, who in fact was NOT ment to be that dark complext as it occure on the net, I know from somone who looked the original sketch up at the Wichita library archive&#41;.  <BR>I would prefere to send you my info, because I would like to have your opinion on the info, is there any possiblity that you could provide an email adress where I can send it.  <BR> <BR>He is a prominent, very rich and well known man of Wichita.  <BR>He is 56 years old.  <BR>He worked VERY hard to get to where he is today.  <BR>He is not married &#40;was once but divorced&#41; but lives with a woman and her 2 children &#40;girls&#41;.  <BR>He has quite an agressive temper and consider himself a hard core born leader.  <BR>He states that he easely get bored and do what he does because he wants to and only out of strong passion and thrills.  <BR>He also was in the oil bussines but thought it was boring.He sold his oil business in the mid-80s. Then he drifted. He traveled, partied, lived on a luxury houseboat on Grand Lake in Oklahoma.  <BR>How competitive is xxxxxx, on a scale from 1 to 10? &#34;Maybe an 11,&#34; a person who knows him for 20 years answered.  <BR> <BR>rectly 2002/2003 he suddenly wants to do a lot for Wichita and at the same time flips out and says that he hates Wichita, and then deniesthat he said it.  <BR>There has been filed charges against him for murder threats, assault, extortion and slander.  <BR>and also a restrain order ect.  <BR>On the net a poster &#40;working for him&#41; tells that he has makes sexual moves on his female workers.  <BR>His father died recently.His father was a native Wichitan, operated several drug stores at Kellogg and Broadway before going to work at the Boeing Co.  <BR>Recently A BIG vision he had was ruined because the criminal records was found out by the press.  <BR>Several of his bussiness are located very close to the crime-scen.  <BR>He has problems with Wichita Eagle, he accuses Wichita Eagle of smear campaign.  <BR>He loves extravagance, wich is a huge part of the way he create his bussiness.  <BR>He has a HUGE passion for the visual media.  <BR> <BR>I could go on but i would prefere to email you all my links to the info.  <BR> <BR>Did his fathers death, the failed big vision and the fact that the whole wichita socity one of a sudden got to know the dirty secrets about his violent carracther spark his come back???  <BR> <BR>Please let me know what you think?  <BR> <BR>&#40;I´m located in Denmark so english is not my first language so please bear over with my spelling ect &#41; <BR> <BR> <BR>I wish I could post the picture of this man next to that sketch cause it IS a match. <BR> <BR>skov  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
