<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3914"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiefron<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiefron<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 10, 2005 - 7:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov, <BR> <BR>I really don&#39;t see the resemblence. Your suspect seems complex. But does he fit the rest of the profile? I have not delved much into this man&#39;s history, if you have post it up.  <BR> <BR>Was he in the military? Was this before or after he worked as an usher? If he was in military, what branch, what MOS or Rating? <BR> <BR>The &#34;violent criminal&#34; past you refer to amounted to some threats that the other party shrugged off after the fact.  <BR> <BR>Your suspect has been a very active citizen in many Wichita civic community. Perhaps you can dig up some information regarding exactly which ones. <BR> <BR>I would be very surprised if this man turned out to be BTK. As far as I can tell he fits none of the characteristics BTK attributed to himself. He is almost a decade too young. His father did not die in the war. He did not move a lot or live near railroads. I see no overt fascination with railroads or rail travel in your suspect. I could not verify military service for your suspect, nor any career outside moving up the ranks in his current business from the bottom to the top except a short time working at Boeing as a die maker. He even jokes that he was probably the worst die maker ever indicating a lack of mechanical apptitude, something BTK displays in spades. In that way, he diverges dramatically from every profile out there. Your suspect is a take charge sort of guy in his professional life, the BTK profiles indicate someone who cannot do this and thus killed to compensate for that lack of ability.  <BR> <BR>For others, if you are having trouble finding the picture, you can either google or go to the Wichita Eagle and search for stories on local politics. You will eventually run into a story that puts out most of the information Skov is citing here. <BR> <BR>I will leave it at this and be OK with it if Tom edits or deletes this. We are coming really close to actually naming the poor fellow.  <BR> <BR>Ron <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
