<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3975"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 11, 2005 - 4:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov, you are as capable of solving the BTK crime as I would be solving your erratic personality. I&#39;m surprised that Tom hasn&#39;t pulled these particular posts because your current quarry could cause alot of misery for you and him, if he chose to. Egomania in any language is ill advised and should not be encouraged. You are using your google-ability and your imagination and the result is a poor example of reason. I reiterate from another forum, aren&#39;t there some local crimes that you could sove? Or at least pretend to do so-becareful, skov, you may just come upon someone that doesn&#39;t grant your limited intelligence the mild guffaw it deserves.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
