<!--Post: 3976--><!--Time: 1105495782-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3976"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 11, 2005 - 6:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Chiefron <BR> Thank you for your great respons, and I assure you I would never feel offended by a repy like yours. I respect compleatly that you or anyone else disagree with my view on things. <BR>I will make a collection of my findings and send them to your email adress. <BR>Today I found out that my POI´s mother worked as a secretary at Wichita State University in the 60th and throughout the 70th. <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
